# .env.local.enc
# Local tier — encrypted in place with dotenvx (run `pnpm exec dotenvx encrypt -f .env.local.enc`).
# Shared dev config lives here, INCLUDING shared secrets (Slack tokens, cipher key) — values are
# encrypted, so this is safe to commit. Only per-developer secrets (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY,
# OPENAI_API_KEY) live in the git-ignored .env.personal overlay, which also overrides this file.
# NODE_ENV is set by the runtime (dev:env), never in a dotenv file.

